+        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.3-3">The basic elements of a node level illustration are</t>
+        <ol type="%c." spacing="normal" indent="adaptive" start="1" pn="section-3.3-4">
+          <li pn="section-3.3-4.1">Processor nodes: Processor nodes are used for processing incoming packets and generating packets with a specified packet format.</li>
